    lg2: checking
    lg3: finished
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 orange
  class lg2 purple
  class lg3 teal
  s0: running
  s1: interrupted
  s2: resumed
  s3: reviewing
  s4: done
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the session drops
  s1 --> s2: no unfinished ticket needs resuming or the dispatcher resumes the unfinished tickets
  s0 --> s3: no ticket is left to build
  s2 --> s3: no ticket is left to build
  s3 --> s1: the session drops
  s3 --> s4: the Suite gate finds the suite red and the run halts or the final report is printed
  class s0 blue
  class s1 orange
  class s2 blue
  class s3 purple
  class s4 teal
